 good to see errors fixed quickly. Personally id prefer less pages, Maybe just 1 Slider for total Yantra bonus' with the option of writing text for them if needed?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1534-totalgit","name":"totalgit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1534_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"742"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-01T11:50:56-07:00","id":1145858,"title":"","content":"I can't figure out the purpose of the checkbox &quot;Is X the Mage's Highest Arcanum?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-01T16:12:33-07:00","id":1145907,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1145858#post1145858\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can't figure out the purpose of the checkbox &quot;Is X the Mage's Highest Arcanum?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> For other-arcana Gnosis max's i assume?<br /> <br /> But i found a error, it wont let you set arcana to 5 if set to not highest as it says Gnosis 6 max non-highest arcana is 4, when its 5","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1534-totalgit","name":"totalgit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1534_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"742"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-02T07:25:12-07:00","id":1146051,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1145768#post1145768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Spreading it over several pages is a bit chunky, but with such large UI it might be inevitable using that site.</div> </div> </div> </div>The &quot;wizard&quot; interface is meant to break the process down into manageable chunks. The idea is that newer players won't get overwhelmed with options, but just have to absorb one section at a time.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1145768#post1145768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here's a few mistakes I've found:<br /> * I found no option to use Rotes.</div> </div> </div> </div>No. This is for improvised casting only. I may add Rotes in future but they have their own wrinkles so probably need their own app.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1145768#post1145768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">* You use the term Advanced Scale for all advanced spell factors when Scale only refers to number of subjects/Size of largest subject/AoE. I think that's why you've also put the Space 4 Attainment for the Range factor when it should apply to the Scale factor.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oops. Everywhere has been moved to Space.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1145768#post1145768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">* Sympathetic Yantras shouldn't provide any dice bonus when Sympathetic Range is used.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fixed!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1145768#post1145768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">* Persona Yantra is locked at +1 when it can provide a bonus of up to +4.</div> </div> </div> </div>Still workingon this one...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1145768#post1145768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">* The final screen says that the Range is Sensory despite choosing Sympathetic Range.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fixed!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1145768#post1145768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Otherwise it seems to work out good.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17915-voidstate","name":"voidstate","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-02T07:26:41-07:00","id":1146052,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>totalgit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1145907#post1145907\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For other-arcana Gnosis max's i assume?</div> </div> </div> </div>Correct. It's just to make sure you don't increase your arcanum dots past the max allowed.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>totalgit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1145907#post1145907\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But i found a error, it wont let you set arcana to 5 if set to not highest as it says Gnosis 6 max non-highest arcana is 4, when its 5</div> </div> </div> </div>Fixed this, too. Good catch! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17915-voidstate","name":"voidstate","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-02T07:28:28-07:00","id":1146053,"title":"","content":"Learned Rotes are just as much improvised as Praxes. Yes, there are a few more rules, but if you're going to make a new app for Rotes then you're going to have to include 95% of this app anyway. Makes more sense to just combine it, imo.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-02T07:28:49-07:00","id":1146054,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>totalgit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1145843#post1145843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like it, good to see errors fixed quickly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks. Being able to update quickly is one advantage of a web app over an installed one.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>totalgit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1145843#post1145843\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Personally id prefer less pages, Maybe just 1 Slider for total Yantra bonus' with the option of writing text for them if needed?</div> </div> </div> </div>But then you'd have to memorise the different Yantra bonuses, and you couldn't do things like alert the user if they haven't used a sympathetic yantra for a sympathetic range spell.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17915-voidstate","name":"voidstate","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-02T07:49:46-07:00","id":1146058,"title":"","content":"I like it too good stuff!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12662-bestial-warlust","name":"bestial Warlust","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"60"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-02T07:58:22-07:00","id":1146060,"title":"","content":"Looks pretty good. I like the Material Design (I'm such a sucker for it). I haven't had a chance to look at it in depth for bugs etc. I'll see if I can tonight. I'll see about helping on the back end some too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-03T11:12:00-07:00","id":1146388,"title":"","content":"Awesome!! We'll put this to good use. Thank you very much Voidstate!! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Userhat Aegpts Vlrs. </span><span style=\"color:#996633\">Coren &quot;Ojos de Fuego&quot;. </span><span style=\"color:#666699\">Mithrael. </span><span style=\"color:#ffcc00\">Menehet.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1349-phersus","name":"Phersus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1349_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T00:52:01-07:00","id":1146926,"title":"","content":"New version uploaded: now featuring Rotes!<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> vs","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17915-voidstate","name":"voidstate","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T01:22:09-07:00","id":1146934,"title":"","content":"I just noticed that you have Dedicated Tool as a +2 Yantra, but in fact it's only a +1 Yantra as it's either a Path Tool or Order Tool.<br /> <br /> Edit: Also, the Persona Yantra dice pool needs to be variable since you can get Persona Yantras from multiple sources, most notably from Shadow Name.<br /> <br /> Edit: You also have check boxes for Yantras allowing me to select one only once, but theoretically I should be able to use two or more Order Tools, Dedicated Tools (Thanks to Soul Stones and Egregore), Path Tools, etc.<br /> <br /> Edit: Location Yantras are also only just +1, not +2.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2632,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","user":"Mrmdubois","date":". 10-05-2017, 04:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-05T03:37:20-07:00","id":1146956,"title":"","content":"Thank you very much! great work!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11688-marciano666","name":"marciano666","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-10T07:55:52-07:00","id":1148585,"title":"","content":"New version just uploaded. I've rewritten the Yantra stuff to allow multiple uses of the same yantra (where allowed) and fixed the bonuses (thanks, Mrmdubois).<br /> <br /> Quite a lot of changes were needed to do this so please let me know if you find any bugs that have crept in!<br /> <br /> Cheers<br /> <br /> vs","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17915-voidstate","name":"voidstate","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-10T09:44:20-07:00","id":1148609,"title":"","content":"Much better, the Dedicated Tool's Yantra bonus has been reduced to 0 though, it should be at +1. That's the only problem I can find this time.<br /> <br /> Edit: actually, a Dedicated Tool can be a +0 Yantra, but it should also be possible for it to count as +1.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2632,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","user":"Mrmdubois","date":". 10-10-2017, 01:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-10T10:13:34-07:00","id":1148617,"title":"","content":"Looks good. I only found a few things.<br /> 1.) The casting time seems to be one turn shorter than it should be when using more than one Yantra.<br /> 2.) Mudras are limited to +5. Now, my group has house ruled that limit a bit so I'm totally fine with the Mudra granting more than +5, but you could put up a warning.<br /> 3.) The Mudra dice bonus doesn't update when changing the Skill rating. This is a bit annoying since changing to a Rote automatically adds Mudra as a +1 Yantra.<br /> 4.) There's no option to specify that the Rote was created by the caster and therefor grant the Rote Action quality to the roll.<br /> 5.) There's no option to cast from Grimoires. When casting from Grimoires you can't use Mudra as a Yantra and you can't change Casting Time from Standard (ritual) to Advanced (Instant). And the spell gains the Rote Action quality.<br /> 6.) Certain boons (especially Boons from Fate) can grant 9 Again, 8 Again and/or Rote Action to spell casting rolls, but the only bonus option is adding additional dice.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-10T10:47:28-07:00","id":1148627,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar11887_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"11887\" data-vbnamecard=\"11887\">Tessie</a> are you sure you can\u2019t use the Mudra Yantra when using a grimore?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-10T10:58:10-07:00","id":1148633,"title":"","content":"Hmm. It might be that if you have memorized the Rote you might get to use the Mudra when casting from a grimoire containing the same Rote, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/114668-ask-a-simple-question-awakened-edition?p=1062962\">but just casting from a grimoire does not allow the use of the Mudra.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-12T02:46:45-07:00","id":1149038,"title":"","content":"Thanks for taking the tim<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1148617#post1148617\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1.) The casting time seems to be one turn shorter than it should be when using more than one Yantra.</div> </div> </div> </div>As I understand it, you can use one Yantra without increasing the casting time. Each additional Yantra adds a turn to the casting time.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1148617#post1148617\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2.) Mudras are limited to +5. Now, my group has house ruled that limit a bit so I'm totally fine with the Mudra granting more than +5, but you could put up a warning.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good idea.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1148617#post1148617\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3.) The Mudra dice bonus doesn't update when changing the Skill rating. This is a bit annoying since changing to a Rote automatically adds Mudra as a +1 Yantra.<br /> 4.) There's no option to specify that the Rote was created by the caster and therefor grant the Rote Action quality to the roll.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's a new bug (it used to work). I'll fix it. Thanks.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1148617#post1148617\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">5.) There's no option to cast from Grimoires. When casting from Grimoires you can't use Mudra as a Yantra and you can't change Casting Time from Standard (ritual) to Advanced (Instant). And the spell gains the Rote Action quality.</div> </div> </div> </div>Might add this in future. Do people use Grimoires much?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1148617#post1148617\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">6.) Certain boons (especially Boons from Fate) can grant 9 Again, 8 Again and/or Rote Action to spell casting rolls, but the only bonus option is adding additional dice.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think players can just remember this. No need to record it in the app.<br /> <br /> Thanks again,<br /> <br /> vs<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/17915-voidstate","name":"voidstate","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-12T04:30:09-07:00","id":1149048,"title":"","content":"About Casting Time, the bug is that the app allows two Yantras without increasing Casting Time rather than just one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-12T06:34:06-07:00","id":1149072,"title":"","content":"And High Speech always adds a turn, even if is the only Yantra.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-13T09:01:36-07:00","id":1149437,"title":"","content":"It would be cool if you could save Spells for later reuse.<br /> <br /> I'm both please and saddened by this app. I'm pleased because it's fantastic. I'm saddened because it really showcases just how complicated the magic system is in Mage. I'll start a thread on this topic...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1470-johnny-awesome","name":"Johnny Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1470_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"447"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-13T16:42:36-07:00","id":1149566,"title":"","content":"I love this tool!!! Thank you so much.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1321-bael-the-cruel","name":"Bael the Cruel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1321_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T15:44:57-08:00","id":1159599,"title":"","content":"I've made a fork on GitHub, trying to fix some of the bugs.<br /> So far I fixed some typos, a bug regarding Duration if set to primary factor, and casting time based on Yantras used.<br /> I actually have a question regarding Mantras: instant casting + Mantra equals 2 turns casting, right? How about instant casting + 1 Yantra + Mantra? Is that 2 or 3 turns?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/341797-aids-for-beginners\" target=\"_blank\">CoD Rules Summary</a>","edited":{"userid":2593,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2593-ynas-midgard","user":"Ynas Midgard","date":". 11-16-2017, 06:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2593-ynas-midgard","name":"Ynas Midgard","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-16T15:52:01-08:00","id":1159604,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ynas Midgard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1159599#post1159599\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How about instant casting + 1 Yantra + Mantra? Is that 2 or 3 turns?</div> </div> </div> </div>2 turns.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T02:04:37-08:00","id":1159750,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1159604#post1159604\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 2 turns.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/341797-aids-for-beginners\" target=\"_blank\">CoD Rules Summary</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2593-ynas-midgard","name":"Ynas Midgard","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-25T20:44:51-07:00","id":1199571,"title":"","content":"I've come across a couple weird things myself, if you're interested in playing around in updating these things some. First, it says that using Advanced Potency has a different level needed to overcome Withstand ratings than standard Potency, even though there's nothing in the book about Advanced Potency doing anything but making it's own dispelling attempt have a higher Withstand rating.<br /> <br /> Second, there wasn't really an option for &quot;Change primary spell factor&quot; as a reach or &quot;Reach cost includes Mana&quot;, though I realize these are sort of corner cases to deal with anyway.<br /> <br /> Lastly, I was curious if there could be something to play around with casting time with the Adamant Hand merit, which would allow the Order tool to be used reflexively and not necessarily take up the action for that turn. Also, the rulebook says that runes take a ritual time to draw, but once it's drawn/tattooed/etc, should that still take the full ritual time?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23771,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23771-acediamond","user":"aceDiamond","date":". 03-25-2018, 11:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23771-acediamond","name":"aceDiamond","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23771_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-25T21:37:39-07:00","id":1199580,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>aceDiamond</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1199571#post1199571\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Lastly, I was curious if there could be something to play around with casting time with the Adamant Hand merit, which would allow the Order tool to be used reflexively and not necessarily take up the action for that turn. Also, the rulebook says that runes take a ritual time to draw, but once it's drawn/tattooed/etc, should that still take the full ritual time?</div> </div> </div> </div>Adamant Hand is only Reflexive on the turn when the spell is cast, otherwise the action being used as a Yantra is Instant as per normal. So the going example is if you use Brawl 3 times in 3 turns you get a Reflexive Yantra of +3 that you can apply to a spell, or you could use Brawl 3 times and on your third turn also cast a Reflexive speed spell on that turn with a +3. Basically, Adamant Hand is a little fidgety, but overall works.<br /> <br /> As for the Runes, yeah, once a Rune is in place it should be possible to cast the same spell with its benefits without too much trouble. For instance if you tattoo Runes for Knit on a cabal-mate then you should be able to take advantage of those Runes whenever you cast Knit on that cabal-mate, you can even use them as the Reflexive Yantra you're entitled to on the first turn spent on casting. From my reading each set of Runes should be unique to a particular spell though. Bright side, some forward thinking with strategic placement of Runes can give you a real edge in certain circumstances.<br /> <br /> As an aside. Invisible Runes should, imo, be considered a way to bypass the time requirement for carving Runes (Well within Prime's purview for messing with Yantras as far as I'm concerned), but you need to have Mage Sight active to take advantage of it when casting a spell that incorporates the Rune Yantra. It's a decent benefit, with the potential downside of making it harder to take more mundane actions while you're using it because MS is up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-27T10:24:44-07:00","id":1200107,"title":"","content":"These are fair points. <br /> <br /> I also noticed one more thing that could be fixed up, though probably not the biggest deal. Making something indefinite costs an extra Reach and a point of Mana, but the calculator only adds the point of Mana and a single Reach used to make the Duration Advanced.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23771-acediamond","name":"aceDiamond","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23771_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T11:23:15-07:00","id":1200894,"title":"","content":"Advanced Potency does not grant a -2 to Withstand.<br /> <br /> Advanced Potency grants +2 to the spell's ability to Withstand dispellation and a +1 die bonus on Clash of Wills rolls with spell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T08:28:25-07:00","id":1202602,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>voidstate</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1149038#post1149038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As I understand it, you can use one Yantra without increasing the casting time. Each additional Yantra adds a turn to the casting time</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1149048#post1149048\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">About Casting Time, the bug is that the app allows two Yantras without increasing Casting Time rather than just one.</div> </div> </div> </div>Perhaps I missed this in the rules somewhere, but where does it say that you are only allowed to use 1 yantra? At Gnosis 1, you can use 2 yantra. In &quot;Effects of Gnosis&quot; on page 86, it says you can use two when you Awaken, and the the table on the same page shows that you can use more Yantra as Gnosis increases.<br /> <br /> Other than that, this is a great tool!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/20475-bethris","name":"Bethris","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar20475_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T09:01:29-07:00","id":1202610,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bethris</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1202602#post1202602\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Perhaps I missed this in the rules somewhere, but where does it say that you are only allowed to use 1 yantra? At Gnosis 1, you can use 2 yantra. In &amp;quot;Effects of Gnosis&amp;quot; on page 86, it says you can use two when you Awaken, and the the table on the same page shows that you can use more Yantra as Gnosis increases.<br /> <br /> Other than that, this is a great tool!</div> </div> </div> </div>Read the quotes you selected again, only one Yantra without increasing casting time. The mistake on the app is that it allows two without Yantras without increasing casting time. The quotes are about the effects of Yantra on casting time, not on the ability to use a certain number of Yantras.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T09:56:13-07:00","id":1202630,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1202610#post1202610\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Read the quotes you selected again, only one Yantra without increasing casting time. The mistake on the app is that it allows two without Yantras without increasing casting time. The quotes are about the effects of Yantra on casting time, not on the ability to use a certain number of Yantras.</div> </div> </div> </div>...ah, I see. I tried picking two yantras and it increased casting time to 2 turns. I assume that's what was talked about, then? In which case I remain humbled for reading it wrong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/20475-bethris","name":"Bethris","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar20475_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T15:38:00-07:00","id":1202766,"title":"","content":"As far as I can tell, it doesn't show the increase on the Factors screen, but it *does* show it on the final screen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8721-taralx","name":"taralx","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-03T15:40:53-07:00","id":1202768,"title":"","content":"Feature request: It would be really nice to be able to click *forward* through stages as well as backwards. Perhaps the tool can remember the furthest point we've reached?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8721-taralx","name":"taralx","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-29T14:38:27-07:00","id":1213188,"title":"","content":"Any chance of adding options for combined spells?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24114-hyperluminary","name":"Hyperluminary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24114_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-29T15:19:29-07:00","id":1213198,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hyperluminary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1145767-improvised-spell-web-app?p=1213188#post1213188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any chance of adding options for combined spells?</div> </div> </div> </div>As soon as those rules are crystal clear....But i dont think this is getting worked on anymore? Perhaps its can be placed on github and others can expand it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1534-totalgit","name":"totalgit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1534_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"742"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}